      "final_text": "美国市场：美国股票上涨（标普500指数上涨0.7%，纳斯达克指数上涨1.1%），半导体板块在上周走弱后出现反弹。美国国债收益率表现分化，短端大幅下行（2年期下行6个基点至2.11%，10年期下行2个基点至4.47%，30年期上行1个基点至4.98%）。美元指数基本持平，黄金上涨1.0%，布伦特原油下跌-0.2%至$72以下。",
      "iterations": 2,
      "seg_status": "machine",
      "source_text": "U.S. markets: U.S. equities were higher (S&P 500 +0.7%, Nasdaq +1.1%) amid a rebound in semiconductors after last week’s weakness. Treasury yields were mixed with sharp declines in the short end (2Y -6bps to 2.11%, 10Y -2bps to 4.47%, 30Y +1bps to 4.98%). The dollar index was flat, gold gained +1.0% and Brent crude fell by -0.2% to below $72.",
