      "final_text": "美国宏观：6月ISM服务业指数为54.0，与市场预期54.0一致，低于5月的54.5；新订单从57.3降至55.1。就业分项从47.9升至51.2，为四个月来首次扩张；价格分项从71.2降至67.7，为2026年2月以来首次跌破70。欧洲市场：欧洲股票下跌（斯托克50指数下跌0.2%），市场消化了俄罗斯持续对乌克兰发动打击的相关消息，以及霍尔木兹海峡船舶通行不确定性带来的影响。",
      "iterations": 0,
      "seg_status": "machine",
      "source_text": "U.S. macro: June ISM Services at 54.0 vs consensus 54.0 and May's 54.5; new orders fell to 55.1 from 57.3. Employment rose to 51.2 from 47.9, the first expansion in four months; while prices decreased to 67.7 from 71.2, the first time below 70 since Feb-26. Europe markets: European equities fell (Stoxx 50 -0.2%) as markets digested headlines around continued Russian strikes on Ukraine and uncertainty over Hormuz vessel flows.",
